  "notes": "USAGE:\n{通話|つうわ} is used in both everyday and technical/business contexts. It refers specifically to voice communication, as opposed to text messaging or data use.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {通話|つうわ}{料金|りょうきん} (call charges)\n- {通話|つうわ}{中|ちゅう} (during a call, on the phone)\n- {通話|つうわ}{時間|じかん} (call duration)\n- {通話|つうわ}{履歴|りれき} (call history)\n- {無料|むりょう}{通話|つうわ} (free calls)\n- {通話|つうわ}を{切|き}る (to end/hang up a call)\n\n{通話|つうわ} is the standard word used by phone carriers and in plan descriptions.",
